<text xml:lang="ta" type="edition">
  <body>
    <div rend="parallel"> 
      <p xml:id="Aink196-kilavi">
       kuṟaimaṟukkappaṭṭa talaimakaṉ piṉṉum kuṟaivēṇṭiyavaḻit tōḻi colliyatu.</p>    <p xml:lang="en">
       Spoken by the confidante, when the hero, his request [already] having been rejected, [came] afterwards desiring [yet another] request</p>
  </div> 
    <div rend="parallel">
      <lg xml:id="Aink196">
<l>kōṭī relvaḷaik koḻumpal kūnta</l>
<l>lāytoṭi maṭavaral vēṇṭuti yāyiṟ</l>
<l>ṟeṇkaḻic cēyiṟāp paṭūun</l>
<l>taṇkaṭaṟ cērppa varaintaṉai koṇmō</l>
      </lg>
      <lg xml:lang="en">
        <l>Oh man of the coast with cool seas,</l>
        <l>Where red prawns happen [= live] in the clear backwaters,</l>
        <l>If you are one who desires the innocent girl with choice bracelets,</l>
        <l>[With] bright bangles cut from conch [and] rich, thick tresses,</l>
        <l>Take [her as] you who married her!</l>      </lg>
    </div>
  </body>
</text>
